Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.07,0:00:12.12,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1500,0)}Under the blue, under the\Nblue, under the big blue sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:21.38,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,700)} The river, the river, the river feeds the fluffy grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:31.80,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s go play hide and seek, in a field of sunflowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:42.23,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Go and fly, high in the sky, you round and shiny soap bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,{OP}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Title TS,0000,0000,0000,,The Boy and The Organ Upon That Day}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.78,0:02:23.61,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Go and chase, go and chase.\NGo and chase the snow white… clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.70,0:02:30.42,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Run along, run along.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:35.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Together with all your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:34.21,KO,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx91}It’s hot as hell and you’re still up this early, doing stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.21,0:02:35.71,KO,'',0000,0000,0000,,What kind of song is that anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.71,0:02:40.56,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everybody at Yomogi Preschool learned that song! It’s very fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.63,0:02:44.58,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,High upon the mountaintop{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.73,0:02:50.75,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.54,0:03:02.93,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that was terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.44,0:03:05.67,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I thought I was going to fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.67,0:03:07.17,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Quiet down over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:10.50,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:13.26,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing up so early on a Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.15,0:03:17.64,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I-I’m airing out my futon!\NThe weather’s so nice today…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:24.33,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Geez. Can’t you do anything without making a ruckus?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:27.56,KT,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,He’s mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.56,0:03:30.90,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Do… ba… to…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:34.83,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.83,0:03:36.67,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Am I all right…?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.67,0:03:37.66,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:41.34,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I told you! I’m a stuffed animal, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.34,0:03:44.94,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Don’t treat me so rough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.40,0:03:44.94,KO,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.94,0:03:45.44,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I’m leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.69,0:03:49.23,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll see you later. Stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.23,0:03:50.06,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:54.67,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,So Chitose-san is seeing Fujimoto-san off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.97,0:03:57.15,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.15,0:03:58.19,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:03:59.21,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:04:03.63,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san was just next door\Nin his room, and now he’s leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:05.98,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,He’s sure got a lot on his plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.69,0:04:07.98,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be…?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:09.36,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.36,0:04:12.87,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,That Fujimoto-san is in two places at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.85,0:04:17.20,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This is not a damn mystery novel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:25.15,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san?! What was that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.15,0:04:26.75,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,It was nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:33.68,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Where’re you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.68,0:04:35.41,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.41,0:04:36.71,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But you’re off today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:39.64,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Since it’s such good weather,\NI’m going to air out the futons!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.64,0:04:42.64,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato, do you even get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.28,0:04:44.64,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Get what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.64,0:04:47.41,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The reason why you came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.41,0:04:50.73,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,To fill the bottle full of confetti!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.73,0:04:56.82,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you do get it, then there has to be other stuff for you to do. Especially on a Sunday!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:58.40,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.65,0:05:08.51,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Right now…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:11.97,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,…I want to be of use to Yomogi\NPreschool. Even if it’s a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.66,0:05:16.73,KP,Pidgeon,0000,0000,0000,,I’m to inform you that the previous head of Yomogi Preschool,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:19.80,KP,Pidgeon,0000,0000,0000,,appears to have been tricked into taking out a loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.43,0:05:22.09,KP,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,The previous head?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:27.82,KP,Pidgeon,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Okiura Sayaka’s father, but he died two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:35.82,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,The trickster is a pretty dangerous fellow, and it involves a close relative of Okiura Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:55.42,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.51,0:05:57.67,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:03.36,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,What’s the matter? Today’s your day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:03.97,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.35,0:06:06.47,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’ve come to air out everyone’s futon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:08.97,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Futons?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.97,0:06:11.78,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Since it’s such wonderful weather we have outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:24.49,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,The weather {\i1}is{\i0} beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.95,0:06:27.30,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I didn’t even notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.19,0:06:32.00,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Let’s air them out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:34.00,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:38.00,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose is really pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:42.13,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,She says she’s glad to have such a\Nwonderful girl like you living there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:47.80,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I also really enjoy being with\NChitose-san, Chiho-chan and Chise-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.40,0:06:50.14,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,And what about your neighbor, Fujimoto-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:54.20,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Has he… been mean to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.87,0:07:00.43,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san has been mean\Nto me, but sometimes he’s not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:02.23,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.67,0:07:04.67,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,What kind of person is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.61,0:07:09.91,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun is actually quite kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.91,0:07:13.43,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,He has been ever since he was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:17.43,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,A little Fujimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:19.37,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t imagine that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.37,0:07:20.57,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Care to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.26,0:07:30.22,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to keep you waiting. I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:31.98,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Sign TS,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Preschool}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:34.53,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,He was so small!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:36.94,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Is that really Fujimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.94,0:07:41.41,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. That picture was taken the\Nday Fujimoto-kun first came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.77,0:07:46.12,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,So Fujimoto-san was a student at Yomogi Preschool?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:48.28,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Nope. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.60,0:07:53.16,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.78,0:07:54.66,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,…was an orphan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.66,0:07:55.94,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Orphan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.63,0:07:58.64,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,What is an orphan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.63,0:08:03.92,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It is a child that doesn’t have\Na mother, a father, or any family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.17,0:08:09.14,KP,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(400,0)} If you aren’t willing to care for it to the end, then leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.14,0:08:12.78,KP,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You’ll never feel complete if you only do things for your own satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.78,0:08:14.39,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,450)} You’re just as bad as the person who abandoned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:17.14,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,So that’s why…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:19.65,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,…he said those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.65,0:08:20.86,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.51,0:08:23.15,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:26.08,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I want to know even more about Fujimoto-san when he was little!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:32.75,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.13,0:08:36.54,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,It was maybe 14 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:40.81,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,My father, you see, he took in Fujimoto-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.41,0:08:44.06,KP,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,I’m home, Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.37,0:08:47.93,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,This is the boy I told you about, Fujimoto Kiyokazu-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:53.02,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-kun. This is my daughter, Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:55.93,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I’m Sayaka. Nice to meet you, Kiyokazu-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.94,0:09:04.85,KP,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, a picture! Let’s take a keepsake picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.85,0:09:06.57,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’ll go get the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.57,0:09:08.99,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Camera… camera…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:15.08,KP,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Sign TS,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Preschool}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.77,0:09:20.14,KP,Okiura,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Preschool has a… “gi!”
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:26.21,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,From that day on, Fujimoto-kun has been coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.21,0:09:29.19,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san looks mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.19,0:09:34.34,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He sure does! He always had that\Nface when he was first settling in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:36.61,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,He never spoke to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.98,0:09:39.35,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Not even to you, Sayaka-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.88,0:09:43.58,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,600)} Yeah… He always kept to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.57,0:09:49.01,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I tried introducing him to the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.45,0:09:52.80,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,They were all very interested in him at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.80,0:09:58.63,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,But since he wouldn’t play with them,\Nthey soon distanced themselves from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.95,0:10:06.63,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,300)} He didn’t seem to have any friends at his school either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.77,0:10:11.84,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,It seemed that no one was close to him personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:14.26,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,and that there was no way to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:17.85,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.26,0:10:24.90,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,You’re supposed to say “I’m back!”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:27.11,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,I hate Kiyokazu-kun! {Gee, doesn’t take a lot, does it?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.11,0:10:28.50,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:32.66,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-chan, bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.66,0:10:35.43,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye! I’ll see you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:55.85,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-kun… do you like the organ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.68,0:11:00.35,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.13,0:11:12.11,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:15.71,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye! I’ll see you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:17.94,KP,walla,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.94,0:11:19.79,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.79,0:11:21.14,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Let’s hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:41.62,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,{Eyecatches}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Ad TS,0000,0000,0000,,{blue box]No Charge; [white box, black text]Promotional Samples; [yellow text]New Product}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.07,0:12:06.63,KM,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Nice, cold beer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.63,0:12:09.47,KM,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,We’re now giving it out for free!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.87,0:12:11.26,KM,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.26,0:12:12.14,KM,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.45,0:12:13.97,KM,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like a nice beer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.64,0:12:16.72,KM,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,We’re on a product campaign!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.72,0:12:17.65,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:19.95,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,May I have that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.95,0:12:22.35,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, yes. It’s a new product.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:24.44,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead and try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:27.42,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:29.83,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro-san will surely be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:41.24,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It was a…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:44.24,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,…beautiful summer day, much like today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:47.25,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,It’s my turn next!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:49.38,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,No, it’s my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.38,0:12:51.31,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,550)} You’ve already had your turn, Kuri-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:54.44,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey, no fighting. Take your turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:55.51,KP,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:58.51,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Will they start blooming soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:12:59.84,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,They will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:04.26,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Because you all did such good job caring for them, they will bloom beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:05.64,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:06.77,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Honest!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.77,0:13:08.15,KP,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:11.80,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, kids. Let’s clean up so we can go play.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:12.77,KP,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:27.54,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.09,0:13:38.84,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Tomo-chan, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:43.88,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,You see, a ball whooshed in, and Tomo-chan got scared and fell!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.51,0:13:46.91,KP,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.91,0:13:48.84,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Tomo-chan, did you hurt yourself anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:49.85,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.04,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.87,0:13:57.47,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Dude, why did you push me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.47,0:13:58.49,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,My bad, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.81,0:14:00.74,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I didn’t think you’d actually fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:04.24,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Up yours! Dang, now I’m all messed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:06.64,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Screw that, hurry up and find the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:08.70,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You’re the one that couldn’t handle the pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.70,0:14:10.50,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,All right, geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.50,0:14:12.14,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Dammit, it won’t come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:15.13,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Why’s this place wet anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.63,0:14:16.64,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.95,0:14:18.76,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,What do you two think you’re doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.31,0:14:22.43,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, we lost a ball here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.43,0:14:25.76,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That was dangerous! You could have hit a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.34,0:14:29.43,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,No one got hit! Why go ballistic?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:31.67,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Get out of the flower bed now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.67,0:14:32.44,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:34.69,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,The kids planted those sunflowers,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.69,0:14:37.44,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,and tended them with all their hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.89,0:14:40.69,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Now they’re just waiting for them to bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:49.66,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Here’s your ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.27,0:14:52.00,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Now apologize to this girl, the kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:53.77,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,and then get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:08.20,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,W-We apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.20,0:15:09.31,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.30,0:15:13.86,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t you know how to tame a ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.86,0:15:15.97,KP,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You should quit passing from the wrong places!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:26.02,KP,Tomo,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-chan…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:29.45,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,What about the sunflower?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.57,0:15:36.71,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.51,0:15:40.71,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,It’s just a little hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.86,0:15:47.05,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,You just tie it down like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.87,0:15:51.69,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,And if you water it every day, I’m sure it will bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.69,0:15:52.78,KP,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:53.31,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:20.56,KP,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Go and chase, go and chase.\NGo and chase the snow white clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:30.02,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Run along, run along. Together with all your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:40.51,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,High upon the mountaintop you can see everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.51,0:16:49.53,KP,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,850)}Let us find, let us find, let us find a new miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:58.62,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You know how Fujimoto-kun is always working several jobs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:16:59.25,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.87,0:17:05.57,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He delivers pizza on a bicycle, delivers newspapers, plus a whole lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.57,0:17:07.07,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,He does that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:08.04,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:12.51,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He puts in that work so he can contribute in paying off the preschool’s debts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.67,0:17:16.48,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,For this preschool?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:18.20,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:19.99,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,He also says he’ll become an attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.69,0:17:23.48,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,He seems to stay up every night studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:27.24,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I really worry about his health.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.99,0:17:44.84,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s soft and fluffy and smells so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.93,0:17:47.86,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That’s the smell of the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.86,0:17:49.38,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,The sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.38,0:17:49.84,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:53.63,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,When you air out futons, they’ll smell like the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.11,0:17:57.35,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Well, at least that what my dad told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:03.86,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then tomorrow we’ll all take an\Nafternoon nap together with the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.41,0:18:07.36,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.36,0:18:10.21,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, did I say something strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.21,0:18:13.14,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,No, absolutely not. It sounded wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.14,0:18:15.87,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I can’t wait until tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.87,0:18:17.94,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let’s finish taking these down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.94,0:18:18.79,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:26.80,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for today. Be careful on your way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.80,0:18:28.94,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I’ll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.87,0:18:34.58,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,The sun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.72,0:18:42.48,KP,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu-kun, welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.48,0:18:44.74,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, play the organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.74,0:18:46.55,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Play it, play it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:49.11,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,It’s Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.11,0:18:50.30,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,You’re right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:51.88,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.45,0:18:56.70,KP,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.28,0:19:03.20,KP,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I’m…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.03,0:19:06.21,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’m back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:09.45,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Kiyokazu! The organ, the organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:10.79,KP,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.83,0:19:24.07,KP,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,We can see, we can see, we can see the red sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.07,0:19:33.99,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Steadily, steadily, we steadily walk faraway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.99,0:19:38.55,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,If tomorrow’s a sunny day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.55,0:19:43.10,KP,'',0000,0000,0000,,Let’s come back and play again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.77,0:19:54.93,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1100)} Let us go, let us go, our homes are over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.95,0:19:59.01,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,See? You got absolutely zilch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.96,0:20:03.32,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,But, but I aired out the futons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.32,0:20:06.17,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I was able to help the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.17,0:20:08.69,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, and I was aired out along with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.69,0:20:10.48,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.48,0:20:12.83,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san? Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.09,0:20:16.28,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I knew it was you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:19.18,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’m glad I caught you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.18,0:20:21.83,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I was thinking you could have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:27.46,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You… you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.46,0:20:32.38,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Of course. Shuichiro-san’s share is in the refrigerator.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:33.67,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Then don’t mind if I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.67,0:20:36.33,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s great, Ioryogi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:38.61,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,All right, time to chug it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:44.28,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Wait a sec! I’ll just hold off on this now and drink it before bedtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.81,0:20:52.21,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku-san, I’m impressed at how you always take care to water the trees in your yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.21,0:20:57.00,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Other than this, there is nothing else I can do for Shuichiro-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.20,0:21:01.94,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,But I am very glad I can be somewhat useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.94,0:21:06.08,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m also very glad when I can do\Nsomething useful for Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.08,0:21:11.25,KM,Kohaku,0000,0000,0000,,Right! It makes one very happy to be useful for someone special.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:14.75,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Someone special?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.39,0:21:23.83,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Preschool is a very\Nspecial place for Fujimoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.83,0:21:29.06,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right. He holds down several jobs at once just for that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.69,0:21:30.90,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s exactly…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.48,0:21:32.90,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,…how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:33.91,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.91,0:21:38.17,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Preschool is also very special to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:42.91,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I want to do my best to be useful for Sayaka-sensei and everyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.41,0:21:47.13,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I will do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:50.72,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you’ll still be doing things your own, wrong, way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.34,0:22:19.49,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back, Kobato-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.49,0:22:20.76,KM,Chiho(?),0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.76,0:22:22.10,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.10,0:22:23.70,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I am home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:25.12,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.12,0:22:27.75,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,You were so cute when you were little!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.24,0:22:29.00,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.00,0:22:34.50,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Also you were ever so passionate about playing the organ!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.65,0:22:37.67,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,How did you know about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.67,0:22:41.48,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei showed me some pictures today!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.48,0:22:42.89,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,I want to see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.89,0:22:43.80,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.80,0:22:46.54,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I also want to see Kiyokazu-kun as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.54,0:22:47.26,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose-san, you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.26,0:22:50.06,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,And he was so small, so cute and all pouty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.06,0:22:50.95,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.95,0:22:52.14,KM,Both,0000,0000,0000,,I want to hear this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.14,0:22:54.23,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, what should I do…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:57.03,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,All right, we’ll wait until Kiyokazu-kun is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Next Episode TS,0000,0000,0000,,Hanato Kobato, Private Eye.}
